[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]后世纪念与艺术形象[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]武侯祠塑像[/font][/b]


[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "成都", "cat": "geography"}]成都[/url][/color]南郊武侯祠东廊文臣14人之一，列第7位（[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "庞统", "cat": "people"}]庞统[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "简雍", "cat": "people"}]简雍[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "吕凯", "cat": "people"}]吕凯[/url][/color]、傅肜、费祎、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "董和", "cat": "people"}]董和[/url][/color]、邓芝、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈震", "cat": "people"}]陈震[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蒋琬", "cat": "people"}]蒋琬[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "董允", "cat": "people"}]董允[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "秦宓", "cat": "people"}]秦宓[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "杨洪", "cat": "people"}]杨洪[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马良", "cat": "people"}]马良[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "程畿", "cat": "people"}]程畿[/url][/color]），塑像高192厘米，清道光二十九年（1849年）塑。


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]邓芝墓[/font][/b]


葬于德阳县青石祠（今重庆市潼南县青石山）。清咸丰八年（1858年）《梓潼县志》载「蜀汉邓芝墓，县西南五里，有二石阙」。蜀中多地另有祭奠墓，为后人纪念其促进吴蜀和好而设。


